Ok, the carriage returns issue looks like its fixed since the error is now past the marker_file parsing.

Your new error is more likely NAs or NaNs in your cds object. Do you get anything when you run:
sum(is.na <http://is.na>(exprs(cds_object)))
sum(is.nan(exprs(cds_object)))
sum(!is.finite(exprs(cds_object)))

The other possibility is that you have rows or columns that are all zeroes. Check this with
sum(Matrix::rowSums(exprs(cds_object)) == 0)
sum(Matrix::colSums(exprs(cds_object)) == 0)

