Ok so the first problem looks like it's something with the tf-idf calculation (you should be able to check_markers with use_tf_idf=T and if you can't, train_cell_classifier will most likely not work), is it possible that you have NAs, NaNs or 0s in your size factors? Look here: pData(cds)$Size_Factor.

I suspect the second problem is a version issue. I only recently added the gene_id_type parameter in response to a request for less used organisms. Are you on garnett version 0.1.4?

