Yup, that’ll do it. Size factors are a scaling factor based on the geometric mean of the column sums of exprs so I’m not sure how you ended up with those values... take a look at your matrix and at the following size factor code. counts is the expression matrix.

cell_total <- Matrix::colSums(counts)
sfs <- cell_total / exp(mean(log(cell_total)))

